---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How PRC collects and uses personal data, aligned to Ghana's Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843).">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">[To finalize before launch — aligned to the Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843).]</p>
      <p><strong>What we collect.</strong> Email addresses you submit for downloads and the newsletter; names and contact details you submit on the consultation and contact forms; standard, privacy-light website analytics.</p>
      <p><strong>How we use it.</strong> To deliver what you requested, to send guidance you subscribed to, and to respond to your enquiries. We do not sell personal data.</p>
      <p><strong>Checkout.</strong> Purchases are processed by our payment partners (Selar, with Paystack and Flutterwave); their privacy notices govern payment data.</p>
      <p><strong>Your rights.</strong> You may unsubscribe at any time and may request access to or deletion of your data by writing to <a href="mailto:info@propertynrentconsult.com">info@propertynrentconsult.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
